{"title":"CEMC Beaver Computing Competition","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>CEMC Beaver Computing Competition</b> (<b>CEMC BCC</b>) is a computing competition for multiple different grades held by <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"CEMC\">CEMC</a>. It is intended to introduce computer science and problem solving.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Beaver_Computing_Competition&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_BCC_(Grades_5-6)\" title=\"CEMC BCC (Grades 5-6)\">CEMC BCC (Grades 5-6)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_BCC_(Grades_7-8)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"CEMC BCC (Grades 7-8) (page does not exist)\">CEMC BCC (Grades 7-8)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_BCC_(Grades_9-10)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"CEMC BCC (Grades 9-10) (page does not exist)\">CEMC BCC (Grades 9-10)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Canadian_Computing_Competition\" title=\"CEMC Canadian Computing Competition\">CEMC Canadian Computing Competition</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Canadian_Computing_Olympiad&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"CEMC Canadian Computing Olympiad (page does not exist)\">CEMC Canadian Computing Olympiad</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Canadian_Informatics_Workshop&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"CEMC Canadian Informatics Workshop (page does not exist)\">CEMC Canadian Informatics Workshop</a></li></ul>\n<p><i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\